<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · text</p><h1 class="enc-title">Hungarian Declaration of Independence</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1849">1849</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Hungarian Declaration of Independence was adopted by the Hungarian parliament at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/debrecen">Debrecen</a> on 14 April 1849, during the revolution against <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/austria">Austria</a>. It dethroned the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/house-of-habsburg-lorraine">House of Habsburg-Lorraine</a> and made <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/lajos-kossuth">Lajos Kossuth</a> governor-president. Russian intervention crushed the independent state within months, and the Hungarian army surrendered at Világos in August 1849.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/hungarian-declaration-of-independence.jpg" alt="Hungarian Declaration of Independence" width="320" height="393" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Madboy74 · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Coa_Hungary_Country_History_(1849).svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
